<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/14/eng@/~part_VII__cl_33__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Except for any purpose of this Act or for the purposes of any civil or criminal proceedings under any written law, any member of the Council, Secretary of the Council, any committee established under this Act or any social work practitioner or social work trainee, whether during or after his tenure of office or employment or period of obtaining experience shall not disclose any information obtained by him in the course of his duties."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/14/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/14/eng@/~part_VII__cl_33__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/14/eng@/~part_VII__cl_33> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/14/eng@> .
