<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/14/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A social work practitioner or social work trainee whose name has been removed from the Register pursuant to paragraph 27(1)(a) and if his appeal is allowed under subsection 28(2) shall be reinstated in the Register and be issued with a practising certificate, temporary practising certificate or interim certificate after he notifies the Registrar in writing of the decision of the reinstatement."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/14/eng@> .
